### Rust
# Cargo Ignores
/target

# Cargo Package
**/dist

# Cargo Vet
**/.cargo-vet

### Coverage
# Written into the repo ROOT, not under /target, so the rule above does not
# cover them: tarpaulin.toml asks for the Xml and Lcov reporters, which emit
# cobertura.xml and lcov.info beside Cargo.toml, and cicd.yml converts the
# second into results.sarif. All three are build outputs of `mise run coverage`
# and regenerate on every run, so they are ignored rather than committed --
# CI uploads them as the `coverage-report` artifact instead.
/cobertura.xml
/lcov.info
/results.sarif
